<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-24807] Outdated .asf.yaml: unexpected key not in schema &apos;allow_force_pushes&apos;</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-24807</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;.asf.yaml&lt;/b&gt; format has changed and we get errors now:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
An error occurred &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;while&lt;/span&gt; processing the github feature in .asf.yaml:

&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;while&lt;/span&gt; parsing a mapping
unexpected key not in schema &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;allow_force_pushes&apos;&lt;/span&gt;
  in &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;ignite-3.git/.asf.yaml::github&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, line 27, column 1:
        allow_force_pushes: &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;
    ^ (line: 27)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/infrastructure-asfyaml?tab=readme-ov-file#branchpro&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/infrastructure-asfyaml?tab=readme-ov-file#branchpro&lt;/a&gt; for more details.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
